### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products/1

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:5176/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic optical mouse",
  "price": 45.99,
  "stock": 15
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:5176/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated high performance laptop",
  "price": 1350.00,
  "stock": 8
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:5176/api/products/2

### Test Validations (Error 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5176/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Producto de prueba con errores",
  "price": -15.00,
  "stock": -5
}